Herdr Task Spaces

Includes a modified version of Herdr App's Spaces sidebar, originally distributed
by Herdr under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
Original sidebar: defaults/mods/spaces/main.js (installed Spaces mod 0.1.11).

Modifications include branch-based task grouping, flattened ungrouped rows,
GitHub PR status badges, configurable group labels, tests, and installation tools.

Herdr's application binaries, fonts, and icons are not bundled. Runtime icon
references use the person's existing Herdr installation.
